"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"Chosen Itail=75\u00b5A to meet power budget. Used Vov_n\u22480.15V for NMOS input pair to get high gain (gain\u22481/(\u03bb\u00b7Vov) with \u03bb\u22480.004 at L=2\u00b5m giving >65dB). Vov_p\u22480.2V for PMOS load to keep swing \u22651.5V. L=2\u00b5m for all devices (max allowed) to minimize channel length modulation. Calculated widths from Id = \u00bd\u00b7\u03bcCox\u00b7(W/L)\u00b7Vov\u00b2 (\u03bcnCox\u2248200\u00b5A/V\u00b2\u00b7\u00b5m, \u03bcpCox\u2248100\u00b5A/V\u00b2\u00b7\u00b5m). Resulting gm\u2248500\u00b5S gives GBW\u224840MHz >10MHz, SR\u224837.5V/\u00b5s, power\u2248495\u00b5W.\",\n  \"W1_um\": 33.0,\n  \"L1_um\": 2.0,\n  \"W3_um\": 37.5,\n  \"L3_um\": 2.0,\n  \"W5_um\": 37.5,\n  \"L5_um\": 2.0,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 75.0\n}"